tr\\u00ean website<\\/li>\\n<li>G\\u1ecdi hotline: [S\\u1ed1 \\u0111i\\u1ec7n tho\\u1ea1i]<\\/li>\\n<li>G\\u1eedi th\\u01b0 b\\u01b0u \\u0111i\\u1ec7n \\u0111\\u1ebfn \\u0111\\u1ecba ch\\u1ec9 c\\u00f4ng ty<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<p>Ch\\u00fang t\\u00f4i s\\u1ebd ph\\u1ea3n h\\u1ed3i trong v\\u00f2ng 30 ng\\u00e0y.<\\/p>\\n<h3>8. COOKIES V\\u00c0 C\\u00d4NG NGH\\u1ec6 THEO D\\u00d5I<\\/h3>\\n<h4>8.1 Lo\\u1ea1i cookies s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng<\\/h4>\\n<p><strong>Cookies thi\\u1ebft y\\u1ebfu:<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Session cookies \\u0111\\u1ec3 duy tr\\u00ec \\u0111\\u0103ng nh\\u1eadp<\\/li>\\n<li>Shopping cart cookies<\\/li>\\n<li>Security cookies<\\/li>\\n<li>Language v\\u00e0 region preferences<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<p><strong>Cookies hi\\u1ec7u su\\u1ea5t:<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Google Analytics<\\/li>\\n<li>Page load time tracking<\\/li>\\n<li>Error monitoring<\\/li>\\n<li>User journey analysis<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<p><strong>Cookies marketing:<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Facebook Pixel<\\/li>\\n<li>Google Ads conversion tracking<\\/li>\\n<li>Remarketing tags<\\/li>\\n<li>Email marketing pixels<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<h4>8.2 Qu\\u1ea3n l\\u00fd cookies<\\/h4>\\n<p>B\\u1ea1n c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3:<\\/p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Ch\\u1ea5p nh\\u1eadn ho\\u1eb7c t\\u1eeb ch\\u1ed1i cookies<\\/li>\\n<li>Xem chi ti\\u1ebft t\\u1eebng lo\\u1ea1i cookie<\\/li>\\n<li>Thay \\u0111\\u1ed5i preferences b\\u1ea5t k\\u1ef3 l\\u00fac n\\u00e0o<\\/li>\\n<li>X\\u00f3a cookies \\u0111\\u00e3 l\\u01b0u<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<h4>8.3 T\\u1eaft cookies<\\/h4>\\n<p>H\\u01b0\\u1edbng d\\u1eabn t\\u1eaft cookies cho c\\u00e1c tr\\u00ecnh duy\\u1ec7t:<\\/p>\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>Chrome:<\\/strong> Settings &gt; Privacy &gt; Cookies<\\/li>\\n<li><strong>Firefox:<\\/strong> Options &gt; Privacy &gt; Cookies<\\/li>\\n<li><strong>Safari:<\\/strong> Preferences &gt; Privacy &gt; Cookies<\\/li>\\n<li><strong>Edge:<\\/strong> Settings &gt; Privacy &gt; Cookies<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<p><em>L\\u01b0u \\u00fd: T\\u1e